  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: da967a0ca1faba14ea2f13ad6e50edd2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Thoren
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Thoren
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9242b3a359ed83c4ab867a321f60a3e8, type: 3}
  age: 78
  gender: 0
  birthdate: 
  appearance: Bald, long and well-groomed chin. Very light blue eyes, dull but deep,
    always looking at the horizon as if looking for something lost. He wears old
    and worn clothes, handmade by his wife. He always wears a scarf that she knitted.
  personalityTraits: 0800000013000000
  motivations: Preserve the memory and traditions of the island, and warn of the
    dangers of losing one's roots.
  background: "Thoren was born on the island when it was still a small, wild, and
    mysterious place. With his wife Elira, they farmed the land, planted trees, and
    raised children who are no longer here. When she died, a part of him crumbled,
    but he didn\u2019t want to leave or change. He became a kind of guardian of memories,
    a quiet voice in the hustle and bustle of the modern world.\r\n\r\nHe distrusts
    change, new machines, straight roads, and cities. But he never says no outright;
    he only asks, \u201CIs it really necessary?\u201D"
  speechStyle: 0
  otherInfo: 'When Thoren meets Laria, the first time his hands tremble at her voice.
    Not from fear, but from the energy she gives off, so alive, so determined, that
    it reminds him of his beloved Elira when he was young.

    He starts looking
    for excuses to talk to her, tell her stories, or simply share silence. He doesn''t
    want to replace anyone, just to feel that what he loved can still flourish in
    someone else.'
